Date: Tue, Nov 8, 2022 at 6:21 PM
Subject: [PWG-Announce] PWG November 2022 Virtual Face to Face - November
15-17
To: <pwg-announce@pwg.org>


Hello All,

The Printer Working Group's November Virtual Face-to-Face event will be
held next Tuesday-Thursday, November 15-17, 2022.

Since this is a virtual event, all sessions will be held via WebEx.   The event
page <https://pwg.org/chair/meeting-info/november-2022-virtual.html> has
the current agenda as well as the teleconference information.  Any and all
interested parties are welcome to attend.  If you have any questions,
please feel free to reach out.

We hope to see everyone there!

Thanks!
Jeremy

Jeremy Leber
Chair, IEEE ISTO Printer Working Group
chair@pwg.org
jeremy.leber@lexmark.com
